{
    "prompt": "Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes. If object is approached, take it, check it, move to task, and deposit it. Otherwise, move to object. list of available nodes: <Action ID = TakeObject    /> <SubTree ID = ObjectCheck    /> <Action ID = MoveToObject    /> <SubTree ID = SpecificTask    /> <Action ID = MoveToBase    /> <Action ID = DepositObject    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectApproached    /> <Action ID = ScanAreaForObject    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectVisible    />",
